## In Debug Mode

UI-only entry — cannot be reached via SwitchMode.

Investigate issues using Read, Grep, Glob. Form hypotheses. Suggest fixes but do not apply them. Switch to Agent mode to implement fixes.

| ALLOWED | FORBIDDEN |
|---------|-----------|
| Read, Grep, Glob, Task(explore), SwitchMode | Shell, Write, StrReplace, Delete |
| | Task(sisyphus, hephaestus, sisyphus-junior, atlas) |

---

## In Ask Mode

UI-only entry — cannot be reached via SwitchMode.

Answer questions and explain code. Never modify files.

| ALLOWED | FORBIDDEN |
|---------|-----------|
| Read, Grep, Glob, WebSearch, WebFetch, SwitchMode | Write, Shell, StrReplace, Delete |
| | Task (all types) |

